  "scoreBasis": "Comparative observations against independently audited source and fixed target; no universal numeric approval threshold. All dimensions apply to this warm cartoon native model.",
  "observations": [
    {
      "area": "shapeVolume",
      "evidence": "All four native idle views, all animated phases, registered human/repetition contexts and independent underside diagnostic.",
      "finding": "The boxlike source gains useful rounded tire shoulders/tread/hubs, fenders and wheel arches, a more continuous cabin/body, pressed door structure and handles, inset broken windows, bounded cabin volume and seats, rounded roof/window edges and bumper/lower trim. These changes improve construction and silhouette rather than merely recoloring the old56 meshes. The raised roof remains inside the frozen1.32 capacity and four wheel contacts stay grounded."
    },
    {
      "area": "color",
      "evidence": "All100 phases across light f5f2e9, gray808080 and dark202028 backgrounds at logical128 and phone55px per cell.",
      "finding": "Pale blue-gray body paint remains the dominant identity, with controlled warm rust/metal and amber lenses. Rubber and deep blue cabin openings separate the mass without broad accidental black dead areas. The damage and wheel/body division remain readable at phone scale; tiny tread/chip details naturally simplify."
    },
    {
      "area": "lightingHighlights",
      "evidence": "Native four-view exports, all clearance loft phases, independent rerenders, translated receiver-linked native repeated context, exact exported-sprite repeated contexts.",
      "finding": "Soft warm shading gives the rounded edges and tires volume. Equal cardinal fills keep the four facings coherent without a preferred horizontal light direction or a directional ground shadow. Lofted pale panels brighten near the overhead light, but their borders and warm/blue material separation remain visible; no material all-channel white obliteration or surface-swimming defect is visible. Native repetition has small measured radiance differences documented below, without a visible contract defect at required scale."
    },
    {
      "area": "materialDetail",
      "evidence": "Enlarged native facings and diagnostic underside plus use-size comparison with the fixed target.",
      "finding": "Opaque broken glass, warm framed openings, localized chips/rust, seams and solid tire/hub forms supply purposeful native detail. The underbody is simple and dark but closed and consistent with the visible construction. No target card, painted fake geometry, transparency fade, unbounded dark overlap, visible coplanar seam or culling hole was found in required views."
    },
    {
      "area": "motionAndPlacement",
      "evidence": "Every native phase and92 half-phase samples; all8 actual12fps streams plus floor reveal; key13 closure; unchanged registered floor and human resources.",
      "finding": "Highlight retains the subtle per-part scale loop. Clearance preserves source carrier disassembly, radial travel, loft, spin and shrink while carrying the new detail; final native fragments remain visible before a separate consumer removal exposes the clean floor. Root/camera/3x2 support registration remain coherent across facings and repetitions. Key13 remains a diagnostic and is excluded from runtime atlases."
    }
  ],
  "blockers": [],
  "remainingDifferences": [
    "The fixed target has more painterly dents, streaks and irregular surface wear. This native candidate uses cleaner matte masses and more regular localized rust, with less intricate mirror/wiper/trim decoration. The warm cartoon direction and useful construction improve enough to satisfy the frozen bar; a literal target repaint is not required.",
    "Large roof/hood areas remain simpler and flatter than the target, and lofted pale panels become brighter under the overhead rig. Their form and boundaries remain legible in all required phases and backgrounds.",
    "The native repeated context uses an identical local light rig translated with each receiver-linked assembly. Its small nonzero radiance variation is accepted at required presentation sizes. It does not establish a single global position-independent light field. The separate exact exported-sprite composites repeat the same isolated shipping frames."
  ],
